  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T Y.3155 provides the requirements and high-level architecture of enhanced SDN data plane (ESDP) for IMT-2020 which aims to provide improved support for relevant requirements of the network. Based on the high-level architecture, it specifies functional blocks, reference points, and the workflow of ESDP.</abstract>
